      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the patch :) \n\nI\u0027m wondering what\u0027s the benefit to have the broadcast session type? It would do the same thing with the le audio encoding data path. If we plan to have the multiple sessions, I am thinking two le audio encoding sessions might be the same as one le audio encoding session and one le audio broadcast encoding session.\n\nFor the offload, adsp only process the audio data, the unicast and broadcast concept could only keep in the bluetooth stack.",
